{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-101","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：截差无理线段与中项无理线段与平方","englishTitle":"The square on the straight line which produces with a rational area a medial whole, if applied to a rational straight line, produces as breadth a fifth apotome.","book":10,"number":101,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.101","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.101/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":101,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-101@raw-87c4041eea3a36ee","contentId":"euclid-10-101","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"87c4041eea3a36ee2c9f93d39b79a496676ba69f22987678fee52785563b3316","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-101.statement","euclid-10-101.construction.1","euclid-10-101.construction.2","euclid-10-101.proof.1","euclid-10-101.proof.2","euclid-10-101.proof.3","euclid-10-101.proof.4","euclid-10-101.construction.3","euclid-10-101.proof.5","euclid-10-101.proof.6","euclid-10-101.proof.7","euclid-10-101.proof.8","euclid-10-101.proof.9","euclid-10-101.proof.10","euclid-10-101.proof.11","euclid-10-101.proof.12","euclid-10-101.proof.13","euclid-10-101.proof.14","euclid-10-101.conclusion","euclid-10-101.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-101.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-101","revisionId":"euclid-10-101@raw-87c4041eea3a36ee","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8e94bde9dd4a3cbfe23d1d6b8cc55e7f1afc59adc7c70ce824d60a2be9bfe160","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The square on the straight line which produces with a rational area a medial whole, if applied to a rational straight line, produces as breadth a fifth apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"正方形直线上有理面积 a 中项无理线段整条,如果适用于有理线段,则以宽度为第5 截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-101.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-101","revisionId":"euclid-10-101@raw-87c4041eea3a36ee","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b9bd356692bda848b74669744ec6788cdb5d27c9d647c51b459659365985ae41","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be the straight line which produces with a rational area a medial whole, and CD a rational straight line, and to CD let CE be applied equal to the square on AB and producing CF as breadth; I say that CF is a fifth apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB成为产生有理面积 a 中项无理线段整数和CD a 有理线段整数的直线,让CD CE 等于AB 正方形 的 和CF 宽数扩大CF;我说CF是第五截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-101.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-101","revisionId":"euclid-10-101@raw-87c4041eea3a36ee","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ec55e30c89c9096e68aade2399d92f78c413b0719d738a984d0b975bc95106b8","citations":["euclid-10-77"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let BG be the annex to AB; therefore AG, GB are straight lines incommensurable in square which make the sum of the squares on them medial but twice the rectangle contained by them rational. [[X. 77](/principles/euclid-10-77)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BG成为AB的附件;因此,正方形的直线为AG,GB,正方形占正方形总数的两倍,有理占正方形总数的两倍；上述对应量不可公度；这里涉及中项无理量。 [[X. 77](/principles/euclid-10-77)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-101.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-101","revisionId":"euclid-10-101@raw-87c4041eea3a36ee","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"415d6649754e62af79da5f628c660bb11c3aef75b387fc0801eadfc3ed6aadf4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To CD let there be applied CH equal to the square on AG, and KL equal to the square on GB; therefore the whole CL is equal to the squares on AG, GB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"CD上可作出CH,AG上可作出正方形,KL上可作出GB;因此,整个CL上可作出CD,AG,GB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-101.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-101","revisionId":"euclid-10-101@raw-87c4041eea3a36ee","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"72f96943b77ac526b878b839b504cda239517077f63d9bbbfe12ba6f9f565da7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the sum of the squares on AG, GB together is medial; therefore CL is medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AG和GB的正方形加起来是中项无理线段,因此CL加中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-101.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-101","revisionId":"euclid-10-101@raw-87c4041eea3a36ee","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"62a08568a554f78fa92912a9bc710cb411717c57f8b1cc1aba453f786a2a22fe","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line CD, producing CM as breadth; therefore CM is rational and incommensurable with CD. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其范围扩大到CM宽,因此CM宽为有理宽,不可公度宽为CD宽。 [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-101.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-101","revisionId":"euclid-10-101@raw-87c4041eea3a36ee","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5b17676c2c145915d5519cc1356e0a6322879c7b44a7131202a0d12339970fca","citations":["euclid-2-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the whole CL is equal to the squares on AG, GB, and, in these, CE is equal to the square on AB, therefore the remainder FL is equal to twice the rectangle AG, GB. [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"还有因为整个CL等于AG,AG,GB其中,CE等于AB时的正方形。因此,剩余的FL等于矩形 AG,GB的两倍。 [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-101.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-101","revisionId":"euclid-10-101@raw-87c4041eea3a36ee","order":7,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a2ae40c8a62c4624d83ebc487a7c142b7afbb7762290da477972ae4e3cb557fe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let then FM be bisected at N, and through N let NO be drawn parallel to either of the straight lines CD, ML; therefore each of the rectangles FO, NL is equal to the rectangle AG, GB:"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FM线在N线上被分成两部分,N线NO线与CD线ML线中的一条线平行;因此,矩形FO线NL线中的一条线等于矩形AG线GB线:"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-101.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-101","revisionId":"euclid-10-101@raw-87c4041eea3a36ee","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9088502865cb61b928516fdb63dcacb6b121e61fd1deb13aa22262db7742c86a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since twice the rectangle AG, GB is rational and equal to FL, therefore FL is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"GB是有理,等于FL 所以FL是有理（相关点与线段：AG）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-101.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-101","revisionId":"euclid-10-101@raw-87c4041eea3a36ee","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"af4d3bef30bb101ad3b7f59eed9a96a5fa468c20f5aa0a54bcac93559bc1f223","citations":["euclid-10-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line EF, producing FM as breadth; therefore FM is rational and commensurable in length with CD. [[X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"适用于有理线段 EF,宽度扩大为FM;因此,FM为有理和长度可公度为CD。 [[X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-101.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-101","revisionId":"euclid-10-101@raw-87c4041eea3a36ee","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"848601538b9de1da838533181fc9011702671c6fcc80243bcc9de2f03252a921","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since CL is medial, and FL rational, therefore CL is incommensurable with FL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,CL是中项无理线段,FL,有理,CL是不可公度,FL。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-101.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-101","revisionId":"euclid-10-101@raw-87c4041eea3a36ee","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"964d1b2458a2c0f4ca46eadcc21fc6242057a3a4b3cc037e17d970c64b7c6b86","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as CL is to FL, so is CM to MF; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore CM is incommensurable in length with MF. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,CL比FL等于CM比MF,因此,CM比CL等于MF；CL 与 FL 之比等于 CM 与 MF 之比；上述对应量不可公度。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-101.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-101","revisionId":"euclid-10-101@raw-87c4041eea3a36ee","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e9689d66c63909b8fca33480f6a6e8446452b520ecf2c95b52eb0af220454a2f","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And both are rational; therefore CM, MF are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore CF is an apotome. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两者均为有理;因此,CM,MF是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;因此,CF是截差无理线段。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-101.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-101","revisionId":"euclid-10-101@raw-87c4041eea3a36ee","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a321b11b3e08b0162890559ededc8cee538ce555a1d527f963c9e2b675a83074","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also a fifth apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,这也是第5个截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-101.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-101","revisionId":"euclid-10-101@raw-87c4041eea3a36ee","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b43dbb88ce14f43b4d1ce12026a282ea6c224e6674ab897defd116b7b1bdc706","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For we can prove similarly that the rectangle CK, KM is equal to the square on NM, that is, to the fourth part of the square on FM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为我们同样可以证明,矩形 CK,KM等于NM的正方形,即正方形的第四部分,即FM。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-101.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-101","revisionId":"euclid-10-101@raw-87c4041eea3a36ee","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2910c12c5137fd080855cf67bacc0a69147220db7eccadd0d14de0ded8bd1f4f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the square on AG is incommensurable with the square on GB, while the square on AG is equal to CH, and the square on GB to KL, therefore CH is incommensurable with KL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AG正方形不可公度正方形GBGBGB正方形AG正方形CH和GB至KL正方形GBKL不可公度KL不可公度KL。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-101.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-101","revisionId":"euclid-10-101@raw-87c4041eea3a36ee","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"588fa7ad477af9fc6098a57c5701d6533e499ea2aa9b4378cdb11e83f7f1e441","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as CH is to KL, so is CK to KM; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore CK is incommensurable in length with KM. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,CH比KL等于CK比KM,因此,CK比CH等于KM；CH 与 KL 之比等于 CK 与 KM 之比；上述对应量不可公度。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-101.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-101","revisionId":"euclid-10-101@raw-87c4041eea3a36ee","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8f7a3bb2ac2809c78055b18cefbd5b5cbac2711fcc03546b6f4ecb4df0920ebb","citations":["euclid-10-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then CM, MF are two unequal straight lines, and a parallelogram equal to the fourth part of the square on FM and deficient by a square figure has been applied to CM, and divides it into incommensurable parts, therefore the square on CM is greater than the square on MF by the square on a straight line incommensurable with CM. [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自那以后,CM,MF是两条不平等的直线,平行四边形相当于FM正方形的第四部分,有正方形不足的数字被应用于CM,分为不可公度,因此,CM正方形比MF正方形大,比正方形不可公度和CM直线的正方形大。 [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-101.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-101","revisionId":"euclid-10-101@raw-87c4041eea3a36ee","order":18,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f107ad0f0d117a82d555d7d5ede12bf948d321a8da1ce6eeb9ecac3019093ae8","citations":["euclid-10-def-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the annex FM is commensurable with the rational straight line CD set out; therefore CF is a fifth apotome. [[X. Deff. III. 5](/principles/euclid-10-def-15)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"附件FM是可公度,有理线段 CD已经列出,因此,CF是第5号截差无理线段Q E D。 [[X. Deff. III. 5](/principles/euclid-10-def-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-101.source","contentId":"euclid-10-101","revisionId":"euclid-10-101@raw-87c4041eea3a36ee","order":19,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"83117ee46b14a4be15271861e6bc2cfb5833b63ae93efb694212c9c2282b49c8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.101/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1